    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "Physical training began today. Myself and five other Avian youths. Obstacle courses, races, all manner of challenges. At the end of the day, we were awarded a score. I came top of my class! I was so proud.",
    "value": "体能历练始于今日。我与另外五位翼族青年一同，穿越障碍赛道，竞速比拼，迎接各类挑战。至日暮时分，我们获评了成绩。我位居同侪之首！我深感自豪。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "As expected, my peers accepted their loss graciously, and we all retired to the mess hall for dinner. It was a pleasant feast; a reward for our first day of the trials, perhaps. I feel so at home here, amongst likeminded Flightless, no talk of the Grounded, just devotion to Kluex.",
    "value": "一如所料，我的同伴们皆坦然地接受了败绩，我们一同前往食堂用晚膳。这是一场愉快的盛宴；或许，是对我们首日试炼的犒赏。身处于此，在这些志同道合的无翼者之中，我感觉如此自在。这里没有关于凡俗之民的闲谈，唯有对克鲁西斯的虔心奉献。"
